      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING SCHRUB (4) comes here after a scorching NG win at The Gardens over 400m in 22.63. In form and looks the one to beat again. MOSTLY SAVAGE (2) is a progressive type who recorded her 9th career win last time out (17.17) at this track. Has a strong winning record here at this journey. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with four wins from four starts. Can make it two on the bounce. RIPPED RACCOON (8) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by a nose at this track in a handy 17.36 beating LITTLE BIT SUPER. One of the leading chances again. EXTRA VOLTAGE (3) placed two runs ago then again in the money last time when second (17.25) at this track in a NG. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw.",
